# MERCATOR, space: title, docked at the start station, a short flight.
# Run: pocketme-sim --boot off --fps 60 --frames 1600 --script mercator-space.script
# (from boards/desktop). MERCATOR's starting settings (2026-11-23): 60 pictures a second,
# the CHASE view and DETAIL HIGH; the scene plays at those and changes no setting.

# Home screen: seven steps right, from BENCH to MERCATOR, then start it.
5 press right
6 release right
8 press right
9 release right
11 press right
12 release right
14 press right
15 release right
17 press right
18 release right
20 press right
21 release right
23 press right
24 release right
32 press south
33 release south

# Frames 40-90: the title menu over the turning ship and planet.
100 press south          # PLAY: docked at JAKEL (FORGE, TECH 5, SECURE)
101 release south

# The market: buy three tonnes of ORE.
140 press down           # MARKET line
141 release down
150 press south          # open the market
151 release south
170 press down
171 release down
180 press down           # ORE line
181 release down
200 press south          # buy 1 t
201 release south
210 press south          # buy 1 t
211 release south
220 press south          # buy 1 t (HOLD 3)
221 release south
260 press east           # back to the dock screen
261 release east
280 press up             # LAUNCH line
281 release up
290 press south          # launch
291 release south

# Flight: full speed out of the station, then a turn back towards it.
310 press west           # faster, to top speed
390 release west
990 press left           # a half turn: the station and the planet come into view
1162 release left
# Frames 1170-1510: the station in front of the planet, a hauler leaving,
# a warden passing, the tow lane from about 1436 (the clip). Still at 1400
# (HAULER 1.9 KM). The launch clip is 282-500: a warden about 1 km ahead
# comes closer and slides past on the left.
